 "notes": [
  "Matching the chosen concept elevation, the car porch sits on the right side (x=15.5..30) with the master suite and its louvered balcony directly above, while the left bay houses the drawing room and Bedroom 2 behind the stone feature pier.",
  "The ground floor provides a spacious parents' bedroom at the quiet rear with an attached dressing and bath, alongside an open-plan kitchen directly connected to the TV lounge and a separate enclosed dirty kitchen, both naturally lit from the rear open space.",
  "The 8 x 14.75 ft stair hall leaves a 3.5 ft landing at the foot and top of the dog-leg stair on both floors; the roof mumty covers the exact stair hall and supports the blue plastic water tank.",
  "All four bedrooms have attached bathrooms and dedicated dressing areas, and every bath touches an exterior wall for natural ventilation.",
  "The ground coverage is 1,440 sq ft (63.3%, well within the 70% LDA limit), leaving the mandated 10 ft front, 7 ft rear, and 5 ft right-side setbacks clear."
 ],
